    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32997" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ŏrīnē</span></b> ,
			ēs, f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>Orine</i>, = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὀρεινή</span>, sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>
